WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.670
Every once in a while, I have this dream.

00:00:03.330 --> 00:00:06.710
It's always in Japan, in a classroom I've never been to.

00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:09.540
I'm friends with everyone there...

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:11.080
And...

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:15.080
One of them is my very best friend.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.250
That's the dream I have sometimes.

00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:33.460
Wha... Huh?!

00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:36.790
What the-

00:00:36.790 --> 00:00:38.920
What? Huh?!

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:40.040
What...

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.920
Hold on, could this be...

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:50.250
That thing where you get summoned to another world?!

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:52.250
<i>Etheric Connect-Crystal Ball, Crest-Invoke [Extrasensory Analysis].</i>

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:55.580
It is, isn't it?! It really is!
<i>Etheric Connect-Crystal Ball, Crest-Invoke [Extrasensory Analysis].</i><b></b>

00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:57.500
All right!
<i>Uncover what powers this otherworlder possesses.</i><b></b>

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:58.790
No more jerks who look at me like I'm trash!
<i>Uncover what powers this otherworlder possesses.</i><b></b>

00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:00.460
No more jerks who look at me like I'm trash!

00:01:00.710 --> 00:01:03.040
Mitsuki Mutou, age seventeen!

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:06.960
Watch as I take off towards a
bright future in this new world!

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:08.290
All right!

00:01:08.290 --> 00:01:11.170
I have it. The Pure Concept this one possesses is...
Yes! Yes! Yeah!<b></b>

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:13.880
Heave, ho!

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:21.210
Wait, what's going on?! You're just kicking me out?!

00:01:21.210 --> 00:01:23.670
What the heck is this?!

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:29.330
Can you believe this?

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:31.630
They could've at least given me some money...

00:01:32.830 --> 00:01:34.170
I'm starving.

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:36.750
That's right, I never got to eat breakfast.

00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:42.920
I guess I'll have to steal something.

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:45.790
No, but if I get caught they'll contact my parents...

00:01:45.920 --> 00:01:49.960
<i>Oh jeez, I'm an idiot. I wish they'd contact them.</i>

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:52.710
I wonder if there's a way to go back...

00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:54.670
Probably not, huh?

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:55.790
Hey, you there.

00:01:56.920 --> 00:01:58.580
Hey, are you listening?

00:02:00.670 --> 00:02:03.630
Helloo? I'm talking to you, gloomy!

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:11.080
I'm sorry, I didn't mean to startle you.

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:14.250
You're a Lost One, aren't you?

00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:16.210
Uh, "lost one"?

00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:18.880
Yeah, you came from another world, didn't you?

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:19.540
What?

00:02:19.540 --> 00:02:21.540
I knew right away from your clothes.

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:22.170
Oh.

00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:26.210
And it looks to me like you're in need of money.

00:02:26.380 --> 00:02:28.630
Uh... That's right...

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:30.210
Then you're in luck!

00:02:30.630 --> 00:02:32.130
My name is Menou.

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:35.880
I'm a pure, just, and strong priestess.

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:45.750
So are you a priestess of some kind of religion?

00:02:45.750 --> 00:02:46.500
That's right.

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:49.380
The church takes in Lost Ones as one of its duties.

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:52.290
If you're looking for help, I've got you covered!

00:02:52.540 --> 00:02:54.460
Really?! Then I really need some money-

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:56.880
Maybe in your dreams, deadbeat.

00:02:58.460 --> 00:03:00.920
"He who does not work, neither shall he eat."

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:04.830
If it's money you want,
you'll have to find a job and work for it.

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:07.000
But, you just said you had me covered.

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:10.830
Our churches are struggling to make ends meet,
especially the smaller ones.

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:14.170
But we can offer a roof over your head, at least.

00:03:15.380 --> 00:03:16.630
Come along with me.

00:03:18.290 --> 00:03:22.630
But really, I never imagined another
world would actually exist.

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:24.750
Are there, like, demon lords and heroes here?

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:26.790
Of course not.

00:03:27.630 --> 00:03:30.250
Oh, I see! I get it now.

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:33.250
This is where I use knowledge from
home to make a name for myself!

00:03:33.250 --> 00:03:34.670
What stuff do I know...?

00:03:34.670 --> 00:03:36.330
Oh, what about mayonnaise?!

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:39.380
Ah yes, mayonnaise. It's pretty tasty.

00:03:39.630 --> 00:03:40.420
You know what it is?

00:03:40.790 --> 00:03:44.750
Lost Ones have been coming
to this world for a long time,

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:47.630
and much of their knowledge has been passed on to us.

00:03:47.920 --> 00:03:49.380
That's why... Look.

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:57.540
<b>Etheric Altar</b>

00:03:58.420 --> 00:03:59.500
<b>Central Post Office</b>

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:03.420
Wow, what is this?

00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:06.330
Lost Ones always come from "Japan."

00:04:06.710 --> 00:04:11.670
Over time, Japanese culture and language
got incorporated into this world.

00:04:13.040 --> 00:04:17.170
Come to think of it,
we were totally talking Japanese and I didn't even notice.

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:18.630
What? You just realized that?

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:19.670
You're kidding me.

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:22.750
More importantly,

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:25.250
could you tell me what happened
when you were summoned?

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:29.380
Based on what you've told me,

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:32.670
it sounds like the one who summoned
you was the king of this nation of Grisarika.

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:37.630
Summoning otherworlders is taboo,
and yet those foolish Noblesse...

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:39.580
"Noblesse"?

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:41.210
Hmm? Oh!

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:45.540
Well, the people of this world are
categorized into three classes.

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:47.420
In the third class are the Commons:

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:50.460
The everyday people who
make up 90% of the population.

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:53.330
In the second class are the Noblesse:

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:55.540
The ones in charge of government.

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:57.630
That means the knights, nobility, and royalty...

00:04:57.920 --> 00:04:59.500
...including King Grisarika.

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:01.540
He's king but he's in the second class?

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:02.420
That's right.

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:06.710
And in the first class are the Faust: those of the Church.

00:05:06.710 --> 00:05:09.380
Like me, they serve the Lord.

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:13.130
We're also in charge of regulating
any Noblesse who violate a taboo.

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:16.130
Then are you going to arrest that king?

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:18.330
I'll report it to my superiors.

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:25.080
I'm busy with the noble mission of aiding people like you:
the penniless and homeless at the bottom of society.

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:27.380
I see.

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:30.330
So considering you're in charge
of a bottom-runger like me,

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:32.710
you must be on the bottom rung in this "Faust" class.

00:05:32.710 --> 00:05:35.880
You shut your mouth.
Do you want me to abandon you here and now?

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:38.960
O Lady Menou,
I know you are great and noble at heart!

00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:40.920
I beg you to have mercy on me!

00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:42.880
As long as you know your place.

00:05:50.130 --> 00:05:54.290
Well, you've got it right that I'm on
the bottom rung in this world, too.

00:05:54.290 --> 00:05:56.170
Apparently, I have no powers.

00:05:57.830 --> 00:06:01.080
They told me that, right after I got summoned.

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:04.580
They examined me with a crystal ball
and found out my power was null.

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:06.330
"Null"?

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:10.880
I bet the other one had some kind of amazing power.

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:13.330
"Other one"?

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:14.500
Yeah.

00:06:14.920 --> 00:06:17.290
When they were going to kick
me out and I tried to get away,

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:18.500
I just happened to see her.

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:21.750
It looked like they summoned another one like me.

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:27.580
I couldn't see her face very well,
but even from afar, she had pretty big boobs.

00:06:28.710 --> 00:06:31.290
<i>Uh-huh. Big boobs are great.</i>

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:33.790
<b>Transmission</b>

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:39.000
Oh, really? I'm on it, Menou.

00:06:43.790 --> 00:06:47.670
There's no need to feel dejected.
I'm sure you have some incredible ability.

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:50.670
Oh, come on. You don't have to cheer me up.

00:06:50.670 --> 00:06:53.880
Having no power makes total sense to me, actually.

00:06:54.040 --> 00:06:55.790
I'm not trying to cheer you up.

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:59.380
Lost Ones always have some kind of power.

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:02.380
As far as I know, there have been no exceptions.

00:07:02.670 --> 00:07:04.170
"Pure Concept."

00:07:04.670 --> 00:07:08.000
That's what we call the powers otherworlders have.

00:07:08.210 --> 00:07:10.000
"Pure Concept"...

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:10.830
That's right.

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:14.580
You definitely have some kind of special power.

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:15.750
For real?

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:18.080
For real.

00:07:20.380 --> 00:07:22.080
Okay, we're here.

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:24.420
That's my church.

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:27.380
...For real?

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:28.500
For real...

00:07:29.290 --> 00:07:32.460
Are you kidding? This place looks totally abandoned.

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:35.670
With no money,
we don't have enough hands to care for the place.

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:42.710
But you know, if your power turns out to be useful,
we might be able to make money out of it.

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:46.420
Wait, is that why you decided to help me?

00:07:46.540 --> 00:07:47.580
Of course not!

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:50.170
I knew you were being too nice!

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:53.670
Anyway! Let's try and figure out what your power is.

00:07:53.670 --> 00:07:55.670
Don't just give up. Come on.

00:07:55.670 --> 00:07:57.630
Man, I don't know.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:01.130
Look, just do it.

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:04.580
Link your consciousness with the power within you.

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:06.630
Try saying this out loud:

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:08.920
"Etheric Connect."

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:12.330
E-Etheric Connect.

00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:24.000
Good. Now let your power flow into it.

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:28.750
<b>Pure Concept</b>

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:28.750
<b><i>[Null]</i></b>

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:34.710
<b>Invoke</b>

00:08:32.880 --> 00:08:34.710
<b><i>[Nullify]</i></b>

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:43.710
I-it disappeared...?

00:08:43.880 --> 00:08:44.920
Wow...

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:48.290
H-hey! Don't point that power this way!

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:49.710
I wouldn't do that!

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:53.250
But this really is amazing.

00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:55.710
To think I'd ever have a power like this...

00:08:55.880 --> 00:08:57.670
Oh, I get it now!

00:08:58.130 --> 00:09:03.500
It's not that your power is null.
<i>You possess the Pure Concept of Null.</i><b></b>

00:09:04.380 --> 00:09:06.330
So that's what that meant...

00:09:07.330 --> 00:09:08.420
<i>Null...</i>

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:12.000
The power to nullify everything.

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:15.500
I get it.

00:09:16.750 --> 00:09:20.710
Anything in my way, anyone I hate,
I can just get rid of them!

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:23.630
That's super powerful!

00:09:23.630 --> 00:09:24.880
Come on, Menou!

00:09:24.880 --> 00:09:27.830
Teach me what I might be able to do with this power-!

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:51.210
<b>What...?</b>

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:51.210
<b>This can't be happening...</b>

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:53.580
<b>No way...</b>

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:53.580
<b>If I erase everything,</b>

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:53.580
<b>I should be able to change</b>

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:53.580
<b>this world to fit me...</b>

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:13.210
I'm amazed that didn't kill you instantly.

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:14.790
But of course, you're a Lost One.

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:29.960
You didn't do anything wrong.

00:10:30.210 --> 00:10:31.920
You're not to blame.

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:34.830
You've done nothing to deserve death.

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:39.710
I'm the villain for having murdered you,
and you're the victim.

00:10:40.170 --> 00:10:41.420
But nonetheless...

00:10:41.710 --> 00:10:46.330
The Lost Ones have brought far
too much harm to our world.

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:52.330
I'm a priestess: pure, just, and strong...

00:10:53.080 --> 00:10:57.040
as well as an Executioner for exterminating Lost Ones.

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:01.460
Every once in a while, I have this dream.

00:11:01.460 --> 00:11:04.710
It's always in Japan, in a school I've never been to.

00:11:05.460 --> 00:11:07.830
I'm friends with everyone there,

00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:10.170
and one of them...

00:11:11.040 --> 00:11:12.540
is my very best friend.

00:11:16.710 --> 00:11:18.580
Every once in a while, I have this dream.

00:11:20.630 --> 00:11:26.670
It's different from my usual tedious life,
in a faraway world where I meet a precious someone.

00:11:27.670 --> 00:11:31.080
Is this... that world from my dream?

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:33.420
<b>Episode 1</b>

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:33.420
<b>The Executioner</b>

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:35.130
I see.

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:38.420
So there were two otherworlders they summoned.

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:42.290
King Grisarika certainly seems to have
gone to great lengths with this scheme.

00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:47.040
As soon as I confirm this information,
I shall make an attempt to infiltrate the castle.

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:49.790
What a hassle you have to deal with, Miss Menou.

00:11:49.790 --> 00:11:51.750
Not at all. It's my duty, after all.

00:11:52.250 --> 00:11:55.080
You should spend some time off there once you're done.

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:57.710
This is your first time back in your
homeland in ten years, isn't it?

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:02.290
Archbishop Orwell,
are you saying you remember me from back then?

00:12:02.580 --> 00:12:04.710
How could I forget?

00:12:04.710 --> 00:12:07.170
When that otherworlder went out of control,

00:12:07.170 --> 00:12:12.000
it could have resulted in a calamity
equal to the Four Major Human Errors.

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:16.170
But at least I was able to save you, the lone survivor.

00:12:16.170 --> 00:12:18.960
Yes. I couldn't be more grateful.

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:21.540
For allowing me to become a priestess, as well.

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:25.130
You have your Master, Flare, to thank for that.

00:12:25.710 --> 00:12:27.920
I understand she trained you well.

00:12:28.210 --> 00:12:28.960
She did.

00:12:29.210 --> 00:12:30.460
Miss Menou...

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:33.000
I hope we can have a nice long chat sometime.

00:12:33.210 --> 00:12:34.290
I'm honored.

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:35.830
I would love to, if opportunity ever allows.

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:37.380
Until next time, then.

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:38.750
Please excuse me.

00:12:56.960 --> 00:12:58.790
I'm... so sorry!

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:00.830
Why? This isn't...

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:06.750
No, I didn't... White... The world...all white... I...

00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:09.790
No, this isn't what... I just wanted... back to Japan...

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:20.380
<i>White, hmm?</i>

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:24.630
<i>This certainly looks like blanching,
</i>but something's different.<b></b>

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:42.130
<i>If this was the second coming of [White],
</i>there wouldn't be any survivors.<b></b>

00:13:44.540 --> 00:13:46.210
Can't even die properly, I see.

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:47.420
You.

00:13:48.000 --> 00:13:49.210
Move.

00:14:08.000 --> 00:14:10.290
You're so half-baked it's pathetic.

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:22.040
Here I come!

00:14:30.750 --> 00:14:33.540
You generated holy ground with a pseudo-church, eh?

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:45.670
You've always had a flair for flashy maneuvers...

00:14:45.670 --> 00:14:47.460
Orwell you old hag.

00:14:47.460 --> 00:14:51.000
You haven't changed a bit yourself, Flare.

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:53.080
You do love acting in secrecy.

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:55.630
My role is different from yours.

00:14:55.630 --> 00:15:00.460
Besides, I don't think it was necessary for you to butt
in on this job of taking care of the otherworlder.

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:03.750
Leave it. I'm going to look around for survivors.

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:05.670
I'll leave that girl in your hands.

00:15:07.290 --> 00:15:09.420
<i>Huh? Isn't this kind of thing your job?</i>

00:15:09.420 --> 00:15:11.290
You recently became a Master, didn't you?

00:15:11.290 --> 00:15:13.830
You should take on an unfamiliar task once in a while.

00:15:19.080 --> 00:15:19.710
Who are you?

00:15:21.790 --> 00:15:23.290
Who am I?

00:15:27.750 --> 00:15:32.000
I'm a priestess: pure, just, and strong.

00:15:35.170 --> 00:15:36.880
My homeland, huh?

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:47.420
My dear Menou!

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:48.580
Momo!

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:52.460
Ahhh, I finally got to meet up with you!

00:15:52.460 --> 00:15:55.830
I can finally charge up on Menou energy!

00:15:55.920 --> 00:15:57.670
Jeez, Momo. Let me go!

00:15:57.830 --> 00:16:00.750
And stop wasting ether!

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:03.920
Demonstrating my love for you is never a waste!

00:16:04.420 --> 00:16:05.460
Don't you know that whenever we're apart,

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:06.420
Hey!
Don't you know that whenever we're apart,<b></b>

00:16:06.420 --> 00:16:07.670
Don't you know that whenever we're apart,

00:16:07.670 --> 00:16:10.790
I feel like my soul is ripped in two?!

00:16:11.080 --> 00:16:13.080
As your first and foremost servant,

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:16.790
your Momo wishes she could stay
with you every moment of every hour,

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:19.290
every day of the year and never,
ever leave your side!

00:16:20.420 --> 00:16:21.420
Ow!

00:16:21.420 --> 00:16:23.920
You're not my "servant," you're my aide!

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:27.130
So, did you find out anything about the other Lost One?

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:28.500
Of course!

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:31.130
They're sheltering her in Grisarika's castle.

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:33.130
I totally figured out her location, too!

00:16:33.250 --> 00:16:35.080
Of course you did. Good work, Momo.

00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:37.710
But...

00:16:37.710 --> 00:16:41.750
There's something I need you to do for the mission...

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:47.460
Uh... What's this?

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:50.000
It's the royal maid uniform!

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:52.210
It suits you so well!

00:16:52.460 --> 00:16:54.130
Do we really need this?

00:16:54.130 --> 00:16:55.790
It looks more elaborate than it needs to be, too.

00:16:55.790 --> 00:16:58.710
Of course we do! It's crucial for going undercover!

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:00.080
Are you sure...?

00:17:04.170 --> 00:17:07.830
But this disguise using etheric camouflage won't do.

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:10.000
I can't keep it under control.

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:14.290
All of Master Flare's inventions are like that.

00:17:14.290 --> 00:17:18.040
You're the only one able to use it that well, as it is.

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:20.750
Momo?

00:17:20.750 --> 00:17:21.500
Yes?

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:24.500
You just recorded an image of me in your scripture,
didn't you?

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:27.130
Huh? What are you talking about?

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:35.330
Hand over the page with the image! You always do this!

00:17:35.420 --> 00:17:39.080
Rip out a page from scripture?
A pious follower like me could never do that!

00:17:39.380 --> 00:17:43.580
Your reverence for our Lord has always been minimal,
even in your training days!

00:17:43.580 --> 00:17:48.290
I don't care about the Lord.
Your image is the only thing sacred in my book!

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:55.460
There's five of them, I figure.

00:17:55.960 --> 00:18:00.920
Don't tell me they caught on to your
investigation of the other Lost One?

00:18:00.920 --> 00:18:03.790
I tortured one of the guards, just a bit.

00:18:03.790 --> 00:18:05.250
Maybe that's why?

00:18:05.380 --> 00:18:07.960
You really need to be more careful
about that kind of thing.

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:09.710
But fine, I'll take care of them.

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:12.250
Would you like me to help?

00:18:12.250 --> 00:18:15.130
No need. Just back me up.

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:22.380
Stop hiding and show yourselves,
knights who serve King Grisarika!

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:26.880
Shut your mouth, Executioner.

00:18:27.130 --> 00:18:30.380
You should have been satisfied
with the one you took out.

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:33.710
Now you're going to die because
you poked your nose in too far.

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:36.670
That's a pretty despicable tactic.

00:18:36.670 --> 00:18:41.460
You summoned two at once,
intending for us to kill one of them.

00:18:41.670 --> 00:18:46.830
Only so we can obtain a great power
to overthrow the Faust's tyrannical rule.

00:18:46.830 --> 00:18:48.420
A trivial sacrifice!

00:18:48.630 --> 00:18:50.830
I see. That makes things easy for me.

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:56.580
I feel no remorse killing corrupt Noblesse.

00:18:56.670 --> 00:19:00.710
<i>We'll be the ones killing you, arrogant dog of the Faust!</i>

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:16.670
You little brat!

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:18.330
You go call for reinforcements!

00:19:18.330 --> 00:19:19.040
Y-yes, sir!

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:22.580
Momo, one of them's getting away.

00:19:22.750 --> 00:19:24.630
Okay, no problem.

00:19:26.210 --> 00:19:28.000
Then how's this?!

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:29.170
<b><i>Invoke</i></b>

00:19:29.380 --> 00:19:31.130
<b><i>Flameblade</i></b>

00:19:38.710 --> 00:19:39.630
Did I get her?!

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:44.830
She blocked it?!

00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:46.790
<b><i>Etheric Connect-Scripture, 2:5-Invoke</i></b>

00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:46.790
<b><i>[Thou shalt know that walls surrounding</i></b>

00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:46.790
<b><i>pious sheep shall never crumble.]</i></b>

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:50.290
Magecraft using scripture?!
She didn't even open her book!

00:19:50.290 --> 00:19:51.290
That was too fast!

00:19:51.540 --> 00:19:55.040
A dagger with a crest and ridiculously fast magecraft...

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:56.710
How is this possible?

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:00.380
Could you be the infamous Flare?!

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:02.380
That's impossible! She's too young!

00:20:02.380 --> 00:20:05.790
Yes, she became a Master ages ago.

00:20:06.790 --> 00:20:08.790
I'm Flare's successor.

00:20:08.920 --> 00:20:11.080
A work of art that she created:

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:12.380
Her Flarette.

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:14.460
<b><i>Etheric Connect-Scripture,</i></b>

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:14.460
<b><i>3:1-Invoke</i></b>

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:14.460
<b><i>[And the oncoming enemy</i></b>

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:14.460
<b><i>did hear the toll of the bell.]</i></b>

00:20:19.460 --> 00:20:20.960
No! Run for it!

00:20:25.500 --> 00:20:28.040
Damn you!

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:34.170
Someone as strong as you...

00:20:34.170 --> 00:20:36.330
Why would you... worship... some fool of a Lord...?

00:20:39.500 --> 00:20:42.830
I'll pretend I didn't hear your blasphemous
remarks against our Lord.

00:20:43.670 --> 00:20:48.830
The one you summoned was a monster
far worse than the likes of me,

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:54.830
but also just a kid,
far more ordinary than I could ever hope to be.

00:20:57.750 --> 00:20:59.540
Momo, how are things on your end?

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:04.080
No problems here!
I took out the one that got away in no time at all.

00:21:04.290 --> 00:21:05.500
Good work.

00:21:06.040 --> 00:21:08.630
But still, we should hurry.

00:21:11.670 --> 00:21:13.170
Please use this nightgown.

00:21:14.630 --> 00:21:16.380
Thank you very much.

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:20.500
Um... Could I maybe take a quick walk outside...?

00:21:20.500 --> 00:21:22.540
I don't have the power to authorize that.

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:25.170
Please make your request to a proper official tomorrow.

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:26.630
Uh, wait! Don't go yet-!

00:21:26.630 --> 00:21:27.790
Excuse me.

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:32.790
I'm being held captive here, aren't I?

00:21:41.170 --> 00:21:42.880
Another world, huh?

00:21:43.420 --> 00:21:46.670
For some reason, I don't feel worried at all.

00:21:46.920 --> 00:21:51.380
I just feel like something's misaligned,
ever since I got here.

00:23:35.130 --> 00:23:39.380
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:35.130 --> 00:23:39.380
<b>The Lost One</b>

00:23:35.540 --> 00:23:38.330
Next episode: The Lost One.
